# fires at the same submenu-relative frame on both sides ⇒ a clean +0-stretch
# v3 join. Verifies the 6-row TITLE variant of the shared render (adds the
# centered "Clear Save Data" row 5 the pause 5-row variant doesn't have).
# No {phasepin} (the title carries no db054 / sim-frame; a fixed rngseed keeps
# the boot deterministic).
